          "message": {
            "text": "The beneficiaryCountry of payment P-010 is \"UK\", which is not a two-letter code of the country table the tool reads (the ISO alpha-2 codes of the UN M49 table). The code of the United Kingdom is GB. Fix: Write the two capital letters of the country, such as GB for the United Kingdom."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
